### Worked examples
<hr style="width:95%;border-bottom:1px dashed black;">

**Stream composition:** macros chain like any shell command:

```Makefile {.language-makefile}
pretty: ; cat data.json | ${jq} . | ${stream.dim} | ${stream.indent}
```

**Logging with an argument:** `$(call ..)` passes positional args:

```Makefile {.language-makefile}
build:
	$(call log.target, building ${app_name})
	@# ... real work ...
```

**Keyword arguments:** `mk.unpack.kwargs` powers the `key=value` idiom used by `mk.import.def`, `compose.bind.*`, and friends (full treatment in
[Argument Parsing]({{mkdocs.site_relative_url}}/argument-parsing)):

```Makefile {.language-makefile}
greet:
	$(call mk.unpack.kwargs, ${MAKEFLAGS}, name, world)
	@printf 'hello, %s\n' "${kwargs_name}"
```

**Tempfiles with auto-cleanup:** `io.mktemp` exports `tmpf` and traps its
removal on exit ([details]({{mkdocs.site_relative_url}}/io.mktemp)):

```Makefile {.language-makefile}
work: ; ${io.mktemp} && echo hi > ${tmpf} && cat ${tmpf}
```

